# The application image must contain the application and nothing else.
# In particular the controller (maintenance/), the server deploy assets and the
# test suite must never ship inside a released artifact: the release is candidate
# code, and the controller is trusted code that stays outside it.
.env
.venv
.git
.gitattributes
.dockerignore
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
data
backups
tests
maintenance
deploy
scripts
docs
*.zip
*.png
Dockerfile
compose.yml
MANIFEST.sha256